[gd_resource type="ShaderMaterial" load_steps=5 format=3]

; M_PanelTrim — machined hardware: bolts, brackets, reveal steps, cross ribs.
;
; This is the only genuinely metallic material in the kit and it exists to give
; the eye somewhere to land. Anisotropy is turned on so the brushed direction in
; the detail normal actually stretches the highlight instead of just wobbling
; it. A trim highlight is what tells you a wall has thickness.

